{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2023-06-28 14:15:00', 'title': "GDIT'S INTELLIGENCE BUSINESS AWARDED $580 MILLION IN CONTRACT WINS", 'text': 'COMPANY TO PROVIDE CYBERSECURITY AND SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES FALLS CHURCH, VA. , JUNE 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAL DYNAMICS INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY (GDIT), A BUSINESS UNIT OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE: GD), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS INTELLIGENCE & HOMELAND SECURITY DIVISION WAS AWARDED TWO CONTRACTS VALUED AT $580 MILLION.'}